                    <p>
<b>Monthly Salesforce User Group</b><br /><br />
Beginning on November 5, 2014, the ASU Salesforce Enterprise team will hold monthly user groups open to all Salesforce users.</p>
                    <p>Each user group will cover updates and questions from:</p>
                  <ul>
                      <li>Service</li>
                      <li>Recruitment</li>
                      <li>Knowledge</li>
                      <li>Training<br />
                      </li>
                    </ul>

                       <p>The team will present information on recent and upcoming releases, user interface tips, troubleshooting, system updates and chatter.                  </p>
                  <h2><strong><font color="#990033">SAVE THE DATE </font></strong></h2>
                       <h3><strong>Wednesday, November 5, 2014 at 10 am<br>
                         CPCOM 120                       </strong><br>
                       </h3>
                       <hr>
                       <p><strong><font color="#990033">COMING SOON: </font> </strong>Salesforce updates and future user group announcements will be posted to Chatter groups. Users will automatically be added to the Service, Recruitment or Knowledge chatter groups. </p>
                    <hr>
                  <p>Questions? Contact Salesforce Support at <a href="mailto:salesforce.support@asu.edu">salesforce.support@asu.edu</a>.</p>
